			(footprint "zulu_a7:TSOPII-54")
			(description "SDR SDRAM, x16, 54-pin TSOP-II   The 54-pin TSOP-II x16 SDR pinout is identical for 256Mb and 512Mb: both use row A0-A12 with banks BA0/BA1, and pin 40 is NC on both. They differ only in the column address width -- A0-A8 (512 columns) at 256Mb, A0-A9 (1024 columns) at 512Mb -- which is a memory-controller setting, not a wiring change.")
